"=================== GO ==================="

<ROUTINE GO ()
	<SETG HERE ,RIVERBANK>
	<COND (<NOT <FSET? ,HERE ,TOUCHBIT>>
	       <INTRO-TEXT>)>
	<SETG LIT T>
	<SETG WINNER ,ADVENTURER>
	<SETG PLAYER ,WINNER>
	<MOVE ,WINNER ,HERE>
	<MOVE ,COMFIT-BOX ,WINNER>
	<MOVE ,THIMBLE ,WINNER>
	<V-LOOK>
	<MAIN-LOOP>
	<AGAIN>>

